(* The specification's section on numerals (Specification/basic/lexical-structure.tex): it is a static error if
   "the numeral has radix 12 and contains letters other than A, B, X, E, a, b, x or e, or contains at least one
   A, B, a or b and at least one X, E, x or e", and X is a letter of radix 12 only.
   This test holds AX_12. XXXNumeralRejectedTwelveMixedAX.test names the rule that refuses it.
   The valid numerals of radix 12 are in tests/NumeralRadixTwelveWalk.fss. *)
component XXXNumeralRejectedTwelveMixedAX
export Executable

run() = println(AX_12)

end
